open gitbash

git --version      --> to check the version

cd ~/Desktop       --> change to desktop

mkdir <filename>   --> create file name ( mkdir facebook)

cd filename        -->change to facebook (cd facebook)

git init           --> it will create local empty repository

git status         --> here are 3 logical areas has created
                        1) working area
                        2) staging area
                        3) local repo


vi filename        --> to create a file (file name anji.java)

git add filename   --> it will take the file from working area to staging
                       1. ( git add .) move all files in current directory
                       2. ( git add * ) move all files in any directory
                       3. ( git add *.java) only move java files

git status          --> check the status

git commit -m "first commit" --> to move local repo

git config --global user.name "Anji-44" --> add username
git config --global user.email "email"  --> add email
git config --global --list              --> to check our username and email

git status

git remote add fb (url)  --> add repository url

git remote -v            --> it will show fetch and push details

git push fb master   --> to push local  to remote repo { fb means alias name} master means branch name}

      if ask the username and passwords --> username anji-44 and pasword we should give token from github

git log --> this command use for how many times we have commit and how many files

git log filename --> to show about specific file

//how to remove (delete)repository?
----------------------------------
go to facebook-->ls-->git remote -v --> {there u you will see fetch and push url`s }

how to remove?
--------------
git remote remove fb ---> (fb means alias name)

how to add?
----------
git remote add fb url

how to see last 2 commits?
--------------------------
git log -2

how to see adding extra content in files?
-----------------------------------------
git show id (commit id)

get back to the files staging area to working area?
--------------------------------------------------
git reset

get back only one file?
-----------------------
git reset filename

                                     	BRANCH
					-------

how to see branches?
-------------------
git branch

create a branch name as development
-----------------------------------
git branch development

switch one branch to another branch
-----------------------------------
git checkout branchname

to display updated content
----------------------------
git commit -a -m "updated"

to display all content in one branch
------------------------------------
git diff branchname

create a branch and switch directly to the newly created branch with one single command
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
git checkout -b newbranchname    ---> -b will create a branch and switch automaticallyy

how to push 2 branches to remote repository
---------------------------------------------
git push fb branch1 branch2

push all branches to remote repository
--------------------------------------
git push fb --all

how to delete branch
---------------------
git branch -d branchname    {we cant delete active branch (present branch)}

how to remove active branch (rename) 
---------------------------------------
git branch -m newbranchname    --> ex: (git branch -m staging) stage is the old branch and staging is the new branch name

how to rename any branch?
------------------------
git branch -m oldname newname

how to display remote repository branches?
-------------------------------------------
git branch -r

to display all branches
-----------------------
git branch -a

to delete remote repository branches
------------------------------------
git push fb :branchname

                                                                          TAG
									  ----

how to create tag?
-----------------
git tag tagname
ex:
    git tag facebookv1.0.0
 (facebook is project name--> v1.0.0 is the version--> v1 is major version and 0 is the minor version 0 is the patch)

how to see tag
--------------
git tag
    (facebookv1.0.0)

how to delete tags?
-------------------
git tag -d tagname

how to push tag?
-----------------
git push fb tag tagname
ex:
   git push fb tag facebookv1.0.0

how to push all tags?
---------------------
git push fb --tags

                                                                             GIT STASH
									     ----------

{ git stash command is temporery storage for current working branch}

we want to change current stage to temporery stage
---------------------------------------------------
git stash

to display how many we have moved in temporery stage
-----------------------------------------------------
git stash list

      it display like:
       stash@{0}
       stash@{1}
       stash@{2}

we want change only specify one
------------------------------
git stash apply stash@{1}

how to delete backup stage?
---------------------------
git stash drop   --> (the recent one is going to delete)

how to delete specific one?
--------------------------
git stash drop stash@{1}

for applying and deleting in one command
----------------------------------------
git stash pop  ---> recent one
git stash pop stash@{1} ---> specific one

